Source: nopipeline
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: nopipeline <noreply@github.com>
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/agus-enc/nopipeline
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)

Package: nopipeline
Architecture: all
Depends: nodejs (>= 22.22), ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: libnotify-bin, xdg-utils
Description: Two-way sync between an Obsidian vault and a Notion database
 nopipeline keeps an Obsidian vault and a Notion database in sync in both
 directions, and keeps the links between notes working.
